They are:
    Owners → usually Full Control
    Members → usually Edit
    Visitors → usually Read

What can they generally do?

Owner:
        Manage permissions
        Add/remove users
        Change site settings
        Create/manage lists and libraries
        Manage content

Member:
        Create/edit content
        Add/update list items
        Upload/edit documents

Visitor:
        Open the site
        View pages
        Read list information
        View documents
